# RULE-BILL01-0001: Invoice amount includes tax

## Summary

The amount shown on an invoice is the net amount plus tax.

## Specification

```text
Given an invoice with a net amount and a tax rate
When  the invoice is displayed
Then  the gross amount is the net amount plus tax
And   the result is rounded half up to two decimals
```

## Decision table

| Tax rate | Net amount | Gross amount |
| --- | --- | --- |
| 0 | any | net |
| > 0 | >= 0 | net + net * rate |
| any | < 0 | rejected |

## Parameters

| Name | Value | Where defined | Configurable |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| roundingScale | 2 | src/INVOICE.cbl:204 | No |

## Inputs and outputs

| Kind | Detail |
| --- | --- |
| Inputs | net amount; tax rate |
| Reads | INVOICE.NET_AMOUNT; TAX.RATE |
| Success output | gross amount |
| Error output | validation error for a negative net amount |

